        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aboolela Simioni ne Lawi ali, “Mwandereere sibi, luno Bakanaani ne Baperisi ne buli mundu owe mu sibala sino alambiila. Babaandu base bali batiiti, ne baaba bali bebuusia alala banjibwaakala nderwa alala ne be nju yase yoosi.”",
          "type": "text",
